				1022,
				8
			],
			"Message": "feat(Wind): Add platform detection and fix Tauri command naming\n\nAdd DetectPlatform() to properly detect OS, architecture, hostname, and release version from the browser context. The CreateProcess and ResolveConfiguration now use platform-specific values for:\n- PATH environment variable (Windows vs Unix paths)\n- execPath (Land.exe vs /usr/local/bin/land)\n- homeDir, tmpDir, userDataDir (platform-specific paths)\n- os.release/arch from actual detection\n\nAlso rename Tauri commands from colon format (`process:get_exec_path`) to underscore format (`process_get_exec_path`) to match Mountain's expected Tauri 2.x command names. Update ProcessPolyfill, SharedProcessProxy health checks, and add proper error propagation for file system errors so VS Code's fileService.js can catch FileNotFound/NoPermissions errors.\n\nThese changes enable the workbench to run on Windows and fix IPC communication with Mountain.",
			"SHA": "845b0911af452942fb4905d1cf17fe56d4abb726"
		}
